                                "sense_id": "64c023d9-9618-3a1a-bda3-7184abc5483b",
                                "text": "If the tumour be termed myeloma the whole process may, for this reason, justly be termed \"myelomatosis.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6eb8086-3d0a-49b8-a51e-1aa450200817",
                                "sense_id": "64c023d9-9618-3a1a-bda3-7184abc5483b",
                                "text": "At the necropsy the bone marrow of all the bones examined was found to be more or less affected by a diffuse sarcoma-like growth of rounded or polyhedral mononuclear cells- a form of \"multiple myeloma\" or \"myelomatosis\"."
                            }
                        ]
